+; RUN: opt -disable-output -passes='print<scalar-evolution>' < %s 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
+;
+; howManyLessThans/howManyGreaterThans: use dominating loop guards on RHS to
+; prove a non-unit-stride IV cannot overflow before the exit is taken.
